Help                                                ●
Keys
enter          choose this port's board
u              update the catalog (Wi-Fi, about 1.5
               MB)
s              set up a repeater or room server, no
               flash
c              saved files
r              look for boards again
j/k            move
esc            quit
hold tab       lock the screen (3 s); tab then enter
               unlocks
j/k scroll  space page  any other key back